      "writtenOn": "2025-01-16T20:26:01Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "The parts that can be changed (such as the number of symbols, their names and hashtable structure) are shared between `ReserveSpaceForDynamicSection` and `PrepareDynamicSection`.\n\nThe set of sections that occupy the reserved space is unlikely to be changed.\n\nThis patch also adds checks to make sure that we do not write outside the reserved space.",
